  "description": "Years of production: 2022-2026\n\nDiscontinued, superseded by the current Escapade. This page is kept as an archive record for owners and for anyone researching an older Cotic Escapade.\n\nEscapade Gen5 added an XL/60cm size for taller riders, Di2-compatible Inside Out cable routing, a wide +2.5mm gravel chainline for extra tyre clearance (up to 650x50 or 700x44), and three \"Anything Cage\" bosses per fork leg. Built from custom butted Cotic Fe cromoly with the Ovalform top tube, paired with the Cotic RB5 full carbon fork (550g, 12x100 thru axle, flat mount brakes). Hand made in Taiwan.\n\nFinishes: Nimbus, Army Green, Froggatt Green and Supernova Orange.",
